stics/docs gap，而不是先定成 bug。P1 diagnostics gap issue，P2 group session key docs PR。\n交付要求：\n1）审查 P1 issue framing 的风险点：哪些表述容易被 maintainer 反驳成 expected behavior。\n2）给出 issue/PR 文案里应避免的措辞，以及建议替换说法。\n3）补一个 maintainer 视角的 objection list + 对应应答。\n请直接回 main，按“状态/任务/结果/原因/建议”格式。","timeoutSeconds":30},"partialJson":"{\"sessionKey\":\"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506\",\"message\":\"状态：派单\\n任务：继续推进 OpenClaw 贡献项目，负责复核和找风险。\\n上下文：当前主方向是把“Feishu 群未显式绑定仍能路由”收敛为 diagnostics/docs gap，而不是先定成 bug。P1 diagnostics gap issue，P2 group session key docs PR。\\n交付要求：\\n1）审查 P1 issue framing 的风险点：哪些表述容易被 maintainer 反驳成 expected behavior。\\n2）给出 issue/PR 文案里应避免的措辞，以及建议替换说法。\\n3）补一个 maintainer 视角的 objection list + 对应应答。\\n请直接回 main，按“状态/任务/结果/原因/建议”格式。\",\"timeoutSeconds\":30}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":123,"output":556,"cacheRead":19712,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20391,"cost":{"input":0.00030750000000000005,"output":0.00834,"cacheRead":0.004928,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0135755}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774413135931}}
