{"type":"message","id":"640189f9","parentId":"dac7d1f3","timestamp":"2026-03-25T04:40:17.131Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 已继续，不等了，直接往前推。\n\n我刚做了两件事：\n\n1. 继续给 xixi / aoao 派了新一轮明确任务\n- xixi：出可直接贴 GitHub 的 P1 issue v2 + P2 docs PR 最小大纲\n- aoao：做 maintainer 视角风险审查 + objection list\n\n2. 我这边已经先落了一版主骨架\n- 文件：`project/openclaw-contrib-2026-03-25.md`\n\n里面已经有：\n- 当前项目策略收敛\n- P1 diagnostics gap issue 标题备选\n- issue 正文 v1\n- minimal reproduction 抽象版\n- P2 docs PR 最小改动大纲\n- 当前建议：先发 P1，再跟 P2\n\n当前判断很明确：\n- 继续打“diagnostics/docs gap”\n- 不先打“confirmed bug”\n- 先拿 issue 存活率，再顺势转 docs PR\n\n下一步我会这样推进：\n- 等 xixi / aoao 回包\n- 我把三方内容合成最终版\n- 然后直接进入可发状态：\n  - P1 英文 issue 定稿\n  - P2 docs PR 改动清单定稿\n\n如果你要更直接一点，我下一条就给你发：\n- 一版可直接发 GitHub 的英文 issue 正文\n- 外加“main / xixi / aoao 今日分工看板”","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d8886978b870ccc0169c3672a48b88191ac4fbc3543553cfc\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":167,"output":332,"cacheRead":22784,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23283,"cost":{"input":0.0004175,"output":0.00498,"cacheRead":0.005696,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0110935}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774413607371}}
