or documentation to figure out what’s going on. This could help me identify any issues and ensure everything is running smoothly. It’s important to stay on top of these tasks!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"找到关键线索了。我再把两处关键文件拉出来：一个是 cron 配置，一个是失败投递队列。这样就能把“漏报是没配，还是配了但发失败”分清。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d8886978b870ccc0169c3e5ba6ef48191a803a6b6913f1a14\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_rrfoYDoH6LxMzlDSqgeFPHaX|fc_0d8886978b870ccc0169c3e5bb8ffc819194f0e30c5a5faf52","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_AgrVBciHw3PC33bjiASL06K8|fc_0d8886978b870ccc0169c3e5bb900c81918a4e9ecef006c9b7","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Lk3h7QA6cDjVSY0mRfw2F5fx|fc_0d8886978b870ccc0169c3e5bb90108191ac82221003e61dae","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"echo '## failed queue'; ls -lt /root/.openclaw/delivery-queue/failed | head -n 10; echo '---'; latest=$(ls -t /root/.openclaw/delivery-queue/failed/*.json 2>/dev/null | head -n 2); for f in $latest; do echo \"## $f\"; sed -n '1,220p' \"$f\"; echo '---'; done","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"echo '## failed queue'; ls -lt /root/.openclaw/delivery-queue/failed | head -n 10; echo '---'; latest=$(ls -t /root/.openclaw/delivery-queue/failed/*.json 2>/dev/null | head -n 2); for f in $latest; do echo \\\"## $f\\\"; sed -n '1,220p' \\\"$f\\\"; echo '---'; done\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":76537,"output":273,"cacheRead":48896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":125706,"cost":{"input":0.19134250000000003,"output":0.004095,"cacheRead":