{"type":"message","id":"35716bb9","parentId":"51ec5b64","timestamp":"2026-03-25T13:40:27.893Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Identifying cron job issues**\n\nI need to pinpoint the root cause of the issue. It looks like there’s no half-hour cron job set up, which may relate to the heartbeat state being irrelevant. I might have promised to create a scheduler but didn’t follow through. Proactive messages might require a cron job instead of a normal reply. There's also no recent failed deliveries, so that's not the problem. I should focus on providing a concise, actionable fix.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0d8886978b870ccc0169c3e5bd692c8191a26debd823986001\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpw-XBa9T4RkENIASfX4lQASZUuBHj9OAedu8PZFv8ZbL_zku7_248KMtRfFr_X64E2uDSrJsvVgl2KHizj3nD7ajYWw4QYX5zM3W-ZKJgaQS_iDLJliP8CY9TMlpWd4tfGMhrIWzetYkZrxpNv46IJT9l9-W8rrlWUZcJm4k5SkerRaigjoSMeuiGFwSNs5K_wew5B1D7-mL6LdCFDcWyqMGjSV8Nugo9uNcFf7RCBE1r8C9q4QMVn9I4aqn-Dc1wT59t5FPSjTui3wVCeEE_JpgrepL0x3xMha3riTn8HS02Tbk7xeWgzzerLB2g58H6n90pytPxOoXTAtHS5pseZm6TMwS5PXsTODUh3HSr82iorvoJ4fcV8i0Y-9zwymSr4ePqDHEqgL1Fnz48F6atGBXyuLvIhMwd4ly8QG-Wagph_Hwy170mvZk_5XGTKTT-sOsb6Kq9ZtD7gHHYwbC2nCkXdgug3u5UQFUADcZHAb96mU0qfD57WBfHWZRRWWbZZ_861nLIlzrz4-M5KDnYmyEITZ8oKut3sieApLpbIDu-Bf-GyIDSpigh7v8CHpLs0tzy2GdnycRtkKIkJLtQxGZLTpBJxQRNJd3L2959074FgUz4yl3PUHQhNEIp5uDvMqncqjGtGd3GFrfOrcEUxKYR3aMzEJaEb-3S61WI8P00oeoKSrPnYt2-x2ZVO56VW7G1raPumuAitM3DXzoMaaFI7JKigJdxfEP77QUGsQGcJTHno8AIkOypPgces-fBB7ErOltPyNgQw4EaGAi0uXkLxBNZ7derTDH8JgBZ3-3XSj8SnHLS389JKO9SKJISGBypZWC9FO7mnN9bQZ_U-CuxSjnTlH7lLDc3WPeZprD5eVJD-6vHPG3K56CwlCveZKYE1WD01PN4OIB5oMHmHgX97Saz-jKYBkU5VpJOFFI6x9J8TBlOQYU5v2-T3vxVNkz1iwPrP_dJTYn8Ue8SEScYtHrnJ8TpHhYbQ56pf7LSxyvvnwBxvYyxfB4Loyox5YkymVN_E32xrCtDD7HT0tO-j3kY7CeBYxIW-S8j2Gqa5pnIywBHqLaS41peQZqpa3iFx4JMfRqEsJb_OLuvyaQ6A-W-GWmqxh53fTr7_lpob1t5oCoUG0CyiqKTh4ug4VBfqplzIvghBZSaSKsk7ap9qaXVQqZ6L0lKCkYW35_DqpuUQV0RPE3Ax3mWi9HxNzkCdaXmOeKU6oCyjtmWMXhUgw79fHeWms8rrvn08iE74fbRA_uXYkGUt5M6t7IgZVWbJgdObPGkQ1afTykhzJJsaT2Nzd58Wpr4We14r3Kmu2vvv5h1mV8F2VR1odqTVsMRD8gfN6IOm-6SSqP-aUx3y_K5r_dgadZ4_DVmqiBSyiq7xPgCqi_aNGxqbFv0RjEQwTFV8WmGkPBZ3EyoBtijnsNvBtobNXWLF0cU_5rUE8te7IYon6bGI2x8uoTRRxjQ\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Identifying cron job issues**\\n\\nI need to pinpoint the root cause of the issue. It looks like there’s no half-hour cron job set up, which may relate to the heartbeat state being irrelevant. I might have promised to create a scheduler but didn’t follow through. Proactive messages might require a cron job instead of a normal reply. There's also no recent failed deliveries, so that's not the problem. I should focus on providing a concise, actionable fix.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 查清了，结论很直接：\n\n## 漏报原因\n**不是发了但没送到。是压根没有把“每半小时汇报”落成自动任务。**\n\n### 证据\n1. **当前 cron 里没有“每半小时汇报”任务**\n我查了：\n- `/root/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json`\n\n里面只有这些相关任务：\n- 每日 8 点晨报\n- 每日 0 点日记整理\n- 每日 5 点学习\n- 每日 21:05 workspace 收口\n- 每日 10:30 OpenClaw 贡献项目推进检查\n\n**没有任何 30 分钟一次的汇报任务。**\n\n2. **失败投递队列里没有这次漏报的记录**\n我查了：\n- `/root/.openclaw/delivery-queue/failed/*.json`\n\n里面只有 3 月 20 号老的失败记录，而且是：\n- `Feishu account \"review\" not configured`\n\n跟你这次“半小时汇报”没关系。  \n说明这次不是“消息发了但失败”，而是**根本没进入发送链路**。\n\n3. **heartbeat 机制也不是干这个的**\n我看了：\n- `HEARTBEAT.md`\n- `memory/heartbeat-state.json`\n\nheartbeat 设计是：\n- 低打扰\n- 有明显新情况才提醒\n- 没新情况就 `HEARTBEAT_OK`\n\n它不是“固定每 30 分钟强制汇报”机制。  \n所以也不能指望 heartbeat 自动替我补这件事。\n\n---\n\n## 真正问题\n**我当时嘴上答应了，但没有同步创建自动执行机制。**\n\n说白了就是：\n- 需求记住了\n- 记忆也写了\n- 但**执行层没落地**\n- 所以到了半小时，系统不会自己报\n\n---\n\n## 补充发现\n还有一个旁证：\n- 21:05 的 `workspace 收口` cron 今晚 actually 跑了\n- 但它 **timeout** 了\n- 状态里有：\n  - `lastRunStatus: \"error\"`\n  - `lastError: \"cron: job execution timed out\"`\n\n这说明 cron 系统本身是活的。  \n所以更能证明：**漏报不是 cron 坏了，是我没加“半小时汇报”这条 job。**\n\n---\n\n## 结论一句话\n**漏报原因 = 我没有把你的新要求从“口头承诺”变成“定时任务”。**\n\n这次锅在我，不在通道，不在 Feishu，不在 cron 框架。\n\n如果你不打断，我下一步就直接把：\n- **OpenClaw 贡献项目半小时汇报**\n落成一个真正的 cron 任务，别再靠我手动记。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d8886978b870ccc0169c3e5c195148191a47b5e2c7b413250\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":3802,"output":730,"cacheRead":125568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":130100,"cost":{"input":0.009505000000000001,"output":0.01095,"cacheRead":0.031391999999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.051847}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774446012209}}
